 that “what if I…?” inclination and see what the cave passes back.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/ce90eeae6dc51d8db9f2d7f8454fe828.avif?t=1783465313\" width=1249 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cave is quiet, but not without your footsteps.<br><br>You’ll bump into:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mischievous dwarves with sharp daggers and sharper tempers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grumpy, red bridge guarding troll.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A noticeably absent giant.  You see that?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flickering hinkypunks and other odd cave-dwellers. A handsome pirate, perhaps?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden treasures, strange artifacts, and places that feel just a little <i>too</i> magical to be natural.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/a98ca46dcd49ab9b4f40226a9265028b.poster.avif?t=1783465313\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/a98ca46dcd49ab9b4f40226a9265028b.webm?t=1783465313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/a98ca46dcd49ab9b4f40226a9265028b.mp4?t=1783465313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some encounters are charming, whilst others are just dangerous enough to keep you on your toes—but it all stays firmly in “casual mystical adventure,” not horror. Just fantasy with a slice of mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That said, all good Adventures suggest one should <strong>save early, save often</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/78bbf8361a248df1854612c105bac165.avif?t=1783465313\" width=1249 height=145 /></span>Colossal Cave 3D leans into that <strong>old-school adventure game</strong> atmosphere: colorful environments, shadowy silhouettes, bats, and a focus on exploring the world for clues rather than being led by the nose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/ee5779c876d6796b91588595bf1ee453.poster.avif?t=1783465313\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/ee5779c876d6796b91588595bf1ee453.webm?t=1783465313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/ee5779c876d6796b91588595bf1ee453.mp4?t=1783465313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No lack of customization allows dialing the game to match your vibe with a variety of options, including comfort tweaks and settings.  Snap turns, or nuke the narrator.  It's all there. Play exactly how you like—curled up with a controller, a mouse, a headset, or a keyboard, <i>slowly</i> dawdling through the cave one cavern at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/3944cbee735f5c81268933de4b005cdf.avif?t=1783465313\" width=1249 height=145 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed, point-&amp;-click exploration in a massive cave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited inventory that makes item choices and puzzle routes matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handy auto-map that shows where you’ve been and where you dropped items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of dwarves, elves, hinkypunks, and other quirky cave creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of logic-driven puzzles with satisfying “aha!” moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-cool adventure vibes inspired by classic games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible customization options so you can make the adventure as meditative and away as you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mythic, mellow <i><strong>cavecation</strong></i>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/77bc356461a9157456a8a2def8a6f9fe.poster.avif?t=1783465313\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/77bc356461a9157456a8a2def8a6f9fe.webm?t=1783465313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/77bc356461a9157456a8a2def8a6f9fe.mp4?t=1783465313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture down into Colossal Cave, follow your curiosity, and see how far your lamp — <i>and your wits</i> — can take you.</p>", "short_description": "A cozy 3D Adventure from Roberta Williams, creator of King's Quest — explore a vast magical cave, solve clever puzzles, and uncover its mystery.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Thai, Arabic, Korean, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“It's actually beautiful... This is one of your crowning achievements...”<br />\r\nGame Grumps (Dan Avidan)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“There is a nostalgic pleasure in it... I also find it fascinating, because which other game today will trap you in a maze and offer no explanation of what you have to do to get out?”<br />\r\nEUROGAMER<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“The drive of pure exploration and discovery as we were transported into a vital moment of gaming history, mixed with the freedom of a modern control scheme, gave us goosebumps.”<br />\r\nNintendo Life<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/fa7457d4fe3a6964343b1fd0b88981baf633e9a9/header.jpg?t=1783465313", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/183c5e0913f37bd007ae6954b8747e339c2acabb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783465313", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/183c5e0913f37bd007ae6954b8747e339c2acabb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783465313", "website": "https://www.colossalcave3d.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590/AMD FX 8350 equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970, AMD Radeon R9 290 equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR, OpenXR<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> For Oculus headsets it’s recommended to remain in the Oculus OpenXR runtime. Also note, Colossal Cave currently does not support older Vive controllers (and a few older Windows headsets) with limited buttons.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9600/AMD RYZEN 5 3600X equivalent or better<br><